  "chapter": "STEAM_AGE",
  "description": "§7Steel§r, ah yes, §7steel§r. A delightful alloy that changed how humanity used machines. It is stronger than §7iron§r, more flexible, and more resistant to oxidization.

Normally, it is quite hard to obtain because of the high purity necessary from the coke.

However, I decided to make it easier, so now you can just craft any of the §7iron dusts§r with any of the §8coal dusts§r to make §7steel dust§r easily!

Once you have a little bit of steel, you can also make an §5Alloy Smelter§r and do the same to save you some tool durability. I suggest making a stack or so of §7steel§r for now and then making more later as you need it.",
